"Val.BraveLittleSapling.1": "Oh, this seems like it'll be very cute.$25",
"Val.BraveLittleSapling.2": "Follow your dreams, Little Sapling. I know you can do it.$1",
"Val.BraveLittleSapling.3": "He did his best and achieved his goals, I'm very proud of him.$20",
"Val.NaturalWonders.1": "I'm glad you appreciate this sort of thing. I do, too.$0",
"Val.NaturalWonders.2": "I find it very unfair that animals seem to be proportionally cute to how dangerous they are.$24",
"Val.NaturalWonders.3": "I just think it's really unfair that petting non-domesticated animals is a health hazard.$29",
"Val.PrairieKing.1": "I love westerns, and I'm a HUGE fan of the Prairie King video game, so this is a dream come true.$16",
"Val.PrairieKing.2": "Cowboys are so cool. Is it too late to change professions?$18",
"Val.PrairieKing.3": "When's the next showing? I'd watch it again! That was perfect, everything I could have wanted.$4",
"Val.Wumbus.1": "Hm. Sci-Fi isn't usually my thing.$6",
"Val.Wumbus.2": "I'm warming up to this, actually.$0",
"Val.Wumbus.3": "If anything happens to Wumbus in the sequel I will not hesitate to commit crimes in his name.$5",
"Val.Mysterium.1": "This is one of my favorites, actually. I'm always glad for them to re-run it. I watch the series it's from at least once a year.$1",
"Val.Mysterium.2": "The director was a real oddball, but his work is nuanced and strange in a way I really enjoy.$25",
"Val.Mysterium.3": "'Through the darkness of future past, the magician longs to see. One chants out between two worlds: Fire. Walk. With. Me.'$32",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.1": "The title sounds familiar... maybe I've seen this before?$29",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.2": "Oh, nope, that was definitely a different 'Howl' movie!$3",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.3": "Could've sworn this was a cute animated fantasy flick, but I was very wrong...$27",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.1": "The posters make this seem like it was produced by a greeting card company.$29",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.2": "I'm not really into the whole holiday warmth trope... It makes me kinda jealous that I don't feel the same way.$24",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.3": "Definitely not my thing, but I'd be happy to see another one with you sometime.$25",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.1": "Oh, I love a good romantic tragedy. Especially one based on a stage show.$0",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.2": "The train makes for a pretty interesting metaphor...$22",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.3": "An excellent story, but I didn't realize how dour the ending would be.$24",
